cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite both the paper and this repository."
title: "What Catalogues Say About Their Own Making: data and code"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and derived data for the DH Benelux Journal article "What Catalogues
  Say About Their Own Making: reading catalogue data as evidence of its production".
  Reads the catalogue of the National Library of Scotland's Moving Image Archive as
  evidence of the labour, resourcing, and institutional conditions that produced it,
  via pairwise text similarity, community detection, and description-structure features.
type: dataset
